format 1

# Seeded by `pklith seed --init` from the fragments this repository's
# files switch on (`pklith detect`). It is yours now: pklith never rewrites it.
#
# Laid one check per commit (nix:T5, nix:V41), in the order actlith's gate
# grew: hygiene, nix, markdown, shell, TOML, Rust lint; spec, character and
# language gates (nix:T6) and cargo steps (nix:T7) follow.

## checks
id|category|nix|glob|check|fix|env|msg
# Overrides the catalog row: its globs miss the extension-less hook shims
# pklith seeds into .githooks/ (pklith overrides it the same way).
shellcheck|lint|shellcheck|.githooks/*, .envrc, **/*.sh|shellcheck --shell=bash {{files}}|-|-|shell script finding
# Relative links and anchors in Markdown resolve, offline, as pklith's row:
# the docs a reader meets first must not point nowhere.
links|lint|lychee|**/*.md|git ls-files -z '*.md' \| xargs -0 lychee --offline --no-progress --include-fragments|-|-|a relative link or anchor is broken
# The registry judges itself, as in pklith and actlith: generated steps
# match .pklith, and every tracked file type has a row.
gen-check|gate|-|.pklith, hk.pklith.pkl, nix/pklith.nix|pklith gen --check|pklith gen|-|hk.pklith.pkl or nix/pklith.nix no longer matches .pklith; run pklith gen
pklith-check|gate|-|-|pklith check|-|-|a tracked file type has no row in .pklith, a row matches nothing, or a claimed check never reaches its files
# Allowed characters per file (.ctrm); ctrm comes from this flake, as in
# actlith.
ctrm|lint|-|**/*|ctrm check {{files}}|ctrm fix {{files}}|-|a file holds a character its set does not grant; fix it, or grant it in .ctrm and say why in the commit
# xenolith: one language per file, as in actlith.
xnl-check|lint|-|**/*.nix, **/*.pkl, .envrc, .githooks/*|xnl check {{files}}|-|-|a host file embeds a non-trivial program in another language; extract it with xnl extract
xnl-lint|lint|-|**/*.nix, **/*.pkl, .envrc, .githooks/*|xnl lint {{files}}|xnl lint --fix {{files}}|-|an embedded or extracted program fails its own language's linter
# rekall: agent prose and the rules extracted from it, as in actlith.
rekall|lint|-|AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, rekall.toml|rekall check|-|-|agent prose drifted from the rules rekall extracted from it; run rekall scan and settle the drift
# xenolith's Rust guards, copied as actlith does (nix:T6).
rust-mirror|lint|-|**/*.rs, nix/guard/rust-mirror.sh|bash nix/guard/rust-mirror.sh|-|-|a Rust file with logic has no sibling tests.rs wired by #[cfg(test)] mod tests;
tdd-order|coverage|-|**/*.rs, nix/guard/tdd-order.sh, nix/guard/tdd-order.exempt|bash nix/guard/tdd-order.sh|-|-|a commit adds Rust code with no test: commit before it in the push range
test|coverage|cargo-nextest|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock|cargo nextest run --workspace --no-fail-fast --status-level fail --final-status-level fail|-|-|a test failed, or the suite is empty
coverage|coverage|sherd|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml, .coverage|sherd coverage --check|-|-|line coverage fell below .coverage
# nix:V46: core.worktree in the shared .git/config redirects every
# worktree; a gate step refuses it.
# V20 (paradigm D40): no private name of the self-hosted instance in
# committed text; names come from the local, untracked .private/denylist.
private-names|gate|-|**/*|bash nix/guard/private-names.sh {{files}}|-|-|a committed file holds a name from .private/denylist
no-core-worktree|gate|-|**/*|bash nix/guard/no-core-worktree.sh|-|-|core.worktree is set in the shared .git/config; unset it
# nix:V47: hk's own Pkl evaluator (pklr) sees the steps `pkl eval` sees,
# each with a command; as pklith's hk-parity.
hk-parity|gate|jq|hk.pkl, hk.pklith.pkl, pkl/**, nix/guard/hk-parity.sh|bash nix/guard/hk-parity.sh|-|-|hk's own Pkl evaluator does not see the steps pkl eval sees
# tests:V61: the vendored GitLab CI schema is the copy VENDORED.md names.
ci-schema-pin|gate|-|tests/schema/**, nix/guard/ci-schema-pin.sh|bash nix/guard/ci-schema-pin.sh|-|-|the vendored GitLab CI schema is not the copy tests/schema/VENDORED.md names
# tests:V19: every rendered pipeline file passes GitLab's CI schema, offline.
gitlab-schema|gate|check-jsonschema|tests/schema/**, tests/fixtures/**, src/**, .gitlab-ci.yml, .gitlab/ci/**, nix/guard/gitlab-schema.sh|bash nix/guard/gitlab-schema.sh|-|-|a rendered pipeline file fails GitLab's CI schema
# Dogfood (nix:T9): this repository's GitHub workflows come from .actlith,
# rendered by the actlith in the dev shell.
actlith-gen-check|gate|-|.actlith, .github/workflows/**|actlith gen --check|actlith gen|-|a generated workflow no longer matches .actlith; run `actlith gen`
actlith-check|gate|-|.actlith, .github/workflows/**|actlith check|-|-|a workflow file is neither generated by .actlith nor listed hand-written
# Dogfood (nix:T32): this repository's GitLab pipeline comes from
# .lablith, rendered by the lablith built here.
lablith-gen-check|gate|-|.lablith, .gitlab-ci.yml, .gitlab/ci/**, scripts/lablith/**, src/**|cargo run -q --bin lablith -- gen --check|cargo run -q --bin lablith -- gen|-|a generated GitLab file or script no longer matches .lablith; run `lablith gen`
lablith-check|gate|-|.lablith, .gitlab-ci.yml, .gitlab/ci/**, src/**|cargo run -q --bin lablith -- check|-|-|a GitLab CI file is neither generated by .lablith nor listed hand-written, or a row would not move to actlith
# Generated docs, rendered by lablith-dev from the files that own their
# facts (dev:V60). Each fix is the generator.
agents-table|spec|-|hk.pkl, hk.pklith.pkl, AGENTS.md, dev/**|cargo run -q -p lablith-dev -- agents --check|cargo run -q -p lablith-dev -- agents|-|AGENTS.md step table is stale
# Offline, as actlith: advisories need a fetched database, so they are a
# push-time step (hk.pkl), not a commit-time one.
deny|supply|cargo-deny|Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, deny.toml|cargo deny check --disable-fetch licenses bans sources|-|-|a license, ban or source rule failed
doctest|test|cargo|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml|cargo test --doc -q|-|-|a doc example failed
rustdoc|lint|cargo|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml|cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --document-private-items -q|-|RUSTDOCFLAGS=-D warnings|docs do not build cleanly

## types
type|checks|min|exempt
*|private-names, trailing-whitespace, final-newline, line-endings, no-bom, no-merge-conflict, no-case-conflict, no-broken-symlinks, no-private-key, ripsecrets, typos, editorconfig-checker, no-local-paths, ctrm, no-core-worktree|-|-
editorconfig|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
gitattributes|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
md|markdownlint, links|-|-
nix|nixfmt, statix, deadnix, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
path:**/SPEC.md|markdownlint, links, mth-fmt, mth-check, sherd-check, sherd-nav, sherd-budget, itok|-|-
pklith|pklith-check, gen-check|-|-
pkl|xnl-check, xnl-lint, hk-parity|-|-
pre-commit|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
pre-push|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
commit-msg|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
envrc|shellcheck, xnl-check, xnl-lint|-|-
sh|shellcheck, shfmt|-|-
gitignore|-|-|git configuration; hygiene steps only
path:flake.lock|-|-|written by `nix flake lock`; hygiene steps only
path:Cargo.lock|deny|-|-
toml|taplo|-|-
rs|rustfmt, clippy, rust-mirror, tdd-order, doctest, rustdoc, test, coverage|-|-
LICENSE|-|-|license text, nothing to lint
context-limits|itok, sherd-budget|-|-
format-upstream|-|-|FORMAT.md ancestry record; hygiene steps only
markdownlintignore|-|-|markdownlint configuration; hygiene steps only
yaml|yamllint|-|-
ctrm|-|-|ctrm configuration; hygiene steps only
ctrm-sets|-|-|ctrm configuration; hygiene steps only
path:AGENTS.md|markdownlint, links, rekall, agents-table|-|-
path:rekall.toml|taplo, rekall|-|-
exempt|tdd-order|-|-
path:.actlith|actlith-gen-check, actlith-check|-|-
path:.github/workflows/*.yml|yamllint, actionlint, zizmor, actlith-gen-check, actlith-check|-|-
coverage|coverage|-|-
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.lablith|gitlab-schema|-|-
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.yml|yamllint, gitlab-schema|-|-
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.lock|-|-|src/detect and src/cli test fixtures: flake.lock samples read by their tests
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.md|-|-|src/report golden output, compared byte for byte by its tests
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.txt|-|-|src/report golden output, compared byte for byte by its tests
path:tests/fixtures/**/*.json|-|-|src/report golden output, compared byte for byte by its tests
path:tests/schema/ci.json|ci-schema-pin, gitlab-schema|-|-
path:.lablith|lablith-gen-check, lablith-check|-|-
path:.gitlab-ci.yml|yamllint, gitlab-schema, lablith-gen-check, lablith-check|-|-
path:.gitlab/ci/*.yml|yamllint, gitlab-schema, lablith-gen-check, lablith-check|-|-
path:scripts/lablith/*.sh|shellcheck, shfmt, lablith-gen-check|-|-
